WEBVTT

00:00:06.633 --> 00:00:10.399
Hello everyone, I'm Chatty Charlie.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.800
Let's practise some informal phrases in English!

00:00:15.466 --> 00:00:16.532
Yes!

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:19.400
What is it?

00:00:20.833 --> 00:00:21.733
Look!

00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:25.633
Yay! Our team won!

00:00:28.466 --> 00:00:30.832
You can use 'Look!'

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:34.866
when you want to direct someone's attention to something.

00:00:39.066 --> 00:00:43.266
Did you see the score? 12 – 0.

00:00:43.266 --> 00:00:46.332
Yeah! That's crazy!

00:00:48.533 --> 00:00:51.433
You can use 'That's crazy!'

00:00:51.766 --> 00:00:55.632
when you want to say something seems unbelievable.

00:01:03.366 --> 00:01:06.399
Shall we watch the tennis match after school?

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:08.066
Why not?

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:11.433
You can use 'Why not?'

00:01:11.933 --> 00:01:15.066
when you want to agree with a suggestion.

00:01:19.433 --> 00:01:22.766
Watching this match is boring.

00:01:22.766 --> 00:01:26.032
It's more fun to play tennis.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:30.900
Well! What are we waiting for?

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:33.533
Let's go play tennis ourselves.

00:01:34.966 --> 00:01:38.166
You can use 'What are we waiting for?'

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:43.300
when you want to say that you should do something immediately.

00:01:48.066 --> 00:01:52.932
Oh, no! We need tickets to see the basketball game tonight!

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:55.500
I can buy them online.

00:01:58.766 --> 00:01:59.599
Got them!

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:04.133
You can say 'Got them!'

00:02:04.966 --> 00:02:07.132
when you've completed an action.

00:02:10.866 --> 00:02:12.232
Let's practise.

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:15.600
I'll say something and you respond

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:18.866
using one of the Everyday English phrases.

00:02:20.466 --> 00:02:22.566
It's so hot today!

00:02:23.633 --> 00:02:24.666
Oh, look!

00:02:24.666 --> 00:02:26.699
We can get an ice cream.

00:02:30.866 --> 00:02:32.899
What are we waiting for?

00:02:35.633 --> 00:02:37.799
I can't find my dog.

00:02:38.966 --> 00:02:40.266
Where is he?

00:02:45.133 --> 00:02:46.433
Look!

00:02:49.233 --> 00:02:53.499
Hey! I've got two tickets to the rugby match tomorrow!

00:02:53.933 --> 00:02:55.233
Want to come with me?

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:01.433
Why not?

00:03:06.366 --> 00:03:09.232
Wow! Did you see that?

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:15.733
That's crazy!

00:03:17.933 --> 00:03:21.133
Have you booked the seats for the basketball game?

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:26.900
Got them!

00:03:29.666 --> 00:03:31.299
After this video,

00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:34.233
think of five more situations

00:03:34.233 --> 00:03:36.133
and test your partner.

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:40.666
Remember, practice makes perfect!